        "zh": "发展经济不能竭泽而渔。",
        "en": "Economic growth must not come at the cost of draining resources dry."
      }
    ],
    "origin": {
      "source": "《吕氏春秋·义赏》",
      "story": {
        "en": "Lüshi Chunqiu: draining the pond may catch fish now, but next year there will be none (竭泽而渔，岂不获得，而明年无鱼).",
        "zh": "《吕氏春秋》：“竭泽而渔，岂不获得，而明年无鱼。”"
      },
      "date": {
        "zh": "秦 · 约前239年",
        "en": "Qin dynasty, c. 239 BC"
      }
    },
    "usage": {
      "en": "Predicate; often 不能/不可竭泽而渔.",
      "zh": "多作谓语。"
    },
    "synonyms": [
